# An instance's own screens, tests and deploy (see .export-exclude). They are compiled in when present, so a checkout can
# hold them; this keeps a `git add -A` from publishing them. A private repository that does track them is unaffected
# (git keeps tracking what it already tracks); add a new file there with `git add -f`.
